- Schema: replay remains v3; bridge protocol remains v1; soak summary advanced to v2 with status, exit code, abort reason, timeouts, and telemetry. DB untouched.
- Tests: authorized Vitest 1,544/1,544; sim 176/176; Node 11/11; both TypeScript configs clean.
- Teardown proof: tests assert bridge and hanging stand-in child PIDs disappear. Process-group SIGTERM with bounded SIGKILL fallback prevents orphans.
- Failure behavior: replay persists with `-aborted`, table exit status is nonzero, and CLI exits nonzero.
